    "Sets H.265 MP4, High 2x, 15 FPS, adaptive VFR, automatic video bitrate, AAC 64 Kbps mono audio, microphone noise reduction, and automatic AV1 archive after recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
