    "The \"Acoustic Echo Cancellation\" is enabled, but it won't work on now.\n\nIf you need to use a specific input with AEC, set it to \"Default\" and select the device you want in System Preferences.\n\nOr you can start recording without AEC.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The \"Acoustic Echo Cancellation\" is enabled, but it won't work on now.\n\nIf you need to use a specific input with AEC, set it to \"Default\" and select the device you want in System Preferences.\n\nOr you can start recording without AEC."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La \"Cancellazione dell'eco acustico\" è abilitata, ma al momento non funzionerà.\n\nSe devi utilizzare un ingresso specifico con AEC, impostalo su \"Predefinito\" e seleziona il dispositivo desiderato in Preferenze di Sistema.\n\nOppure puoi iniziare a registrare senza AEC."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您已启用\"消除麦克风回声\", 但很可惜程序内自定义麦克风不支持此功能!\n\n如需在特定的麦克风上使用回音消除功能, 请将麦克风选项设为\"系统默认\", 并在系统偏好设置中选择您需要使用的输入设备.\n\n或者直接开始录制 (不使用回声消除功能)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您已啟用\"消除麥克風回聲\", 但很可惜程式內自定義麥克風不支援此功能!\n\n如需在特定的麥克風上使用迴音消除功能, 請將麥克風選項設為\"系統預設\", 並在系統偏好設定中選擇您需要使用的輸入裝置.\n\n或者直接開始錄製 (不使用回聲消除功能)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The archive output is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The archive output is missing."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manca l'output dell'archivio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "归档输出文件不存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "封存輸出檔案不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original recording no longer exists. This task cannot be restarted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original recording no longer exists. This task cannot be restarted."
          }
        },
        "it": {
